            <title>[LU-20746] el10.2 review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1 sanity test_setup: timeout</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20746</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@dilger.ca&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run:&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/e833dd76-4360-4eef-b554-3630e4c68204&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/e833dd76-4360-4eef-b554-3630e4c68204&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_setup fails 100% of el10.2 review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1 runs during the initial mount. There are no longer el10.1 sessions being run (this is an optional session that was skipped due to the large test backlog), but 4 weeks ago when they &lt;em&gt;were&lt;/em&gt; being run they passed. All of the el9.8 sessions are passing. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the following messages appear repeatedly on the client console for each target: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: /usr/sbin/lctl mark Setting sptlrpc rule: lustre.srpc.flavor.default.cli2ost=ski
LustreError: 17193:0:(gss_keyring.c:1805:gss_kt_update()) lustre-OST0000_UUID at 10.240.24.28@tcp: negotiation: rpc err -13, gss err 0
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

